{"name": "Open The Gate: Just A Little", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fantasy medieval battlefield where Tower Defense meets Real Time Strategy. Lead   through a campaign as you control group of units, capture towers and push forward to bring down the enemy castle. Face different legions: Crusader, Orc, Undead, and Dynasty.\u00a0Each equips with their own army and special skill, and a powerful dragon  at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new units as you progress, enhance with upgrade tree, and promote units into stronger forms with unique titles that boost their stats. Use special legion skills at the right moment to turn the tide, with a mix of planning, grouping, marching and a little bit of luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/extras/62d97697b779ef57a1b6d1b0b175c565.avif?t=1786674936\" width=\"470\"/></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create your own combination of army to fight and gather gold from fallen foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use gold wisely to train more soldiers and prepare your line of army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/extras/fb68a9e599ab71776769385dcf804985.poster.avif?t=1786674936\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/extras/fb68a9e599ab71776769385dcf804985.webm?t=1786674936\" type=\"vid