0/extras/b2a41e40626482bbe87e71aeff05dc16.poster.avif?t=1786674936\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/extras/b2a41e40626482bbe87e71aeff05dc16.webm?t=1786674936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/extras/b2a41e40626482bbe87e71aeff05dc16.mp4?t=1786674936\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/extras/62d97697b779ef57a1b6d1b0b175c565.avif?t=1786674936\" width=\"470\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABOUT US</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We are a developer and an artist duo \ud83d\udc08\ud83d\udc15.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We argued a lot during game making, but things worked out at the end! </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Medieval Tower Defense and Real-time Strategy hybrid where positioning, gold farming and tower capturing decide the outcome against waves of legions and dragons.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244210/2fec41fba7e6936011ddfad8076ed8e2764141ce/header.jpg?t=1786674936", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Fantasy", "Casual", "Simulation", "Medieval", "Idler"], "developers": "Abubu Dance", "publishers": "Abubu Dance", "release_date": "Aug 13, 2026", "price": "$4.79", "appid": "4244210", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "13 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/HaHgLqgTd6Q", "first_seen": 1786579200.0, "review_rank": 112}